#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:6 6c7fe568394146e288a66eb0068323f9
msgid "使用须知"
msgstr "Notes"

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:8 325467382e7b47ad975453a133de3b83
msgid "欢迎使用中国 SKA 区域中心（cnSRC）平台。"
msgstr "Welcome to the China SKA Regional Centre (cnSRC) platform."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:10 a8261791b529497ab027ed943115ea2b
msgid "本文档是 cnSRC 用户使用文档，内容包括账号注册与审批、平台登录、作业运行、数据传输和软件环境使用等。"
msgstr ""
"This document is the cnSRC user guide, covering account registration and "
"approval, platform login, job execution, data transfer, and software "
"environments."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:12 ff08d66c61e9448a8a29e5919310a75f
msgid "本手册的功能分区与操作流程参考 SRCNet 平台通用设计，若界面按钮名称或页面路径有调整，请以 cnSRC 平台实际显示为准。"
msgstr ""
"Section layout and workflows follow common SRCNet platform design. If button"
" names or page paths differ, follow what the live cnSRC platform shows."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:16 fe072e43106e4c60beb0836599bae1f0
msgid "平台说明"
msgstr "Platform Overview"

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:18 aa3e034da1014d8dba1ab835986410fd
msgid "cnSRC 面向 SKA 相关科学研究与数据处理场景，提供 CPU/GPU 算力、共享存储和常用科学软件环境。"
msgstr ""
"cnSRC supports SKA-related research and data processing with CPU/GPU "
"compute, shared storage, and common scientific software environments."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:20 6c3d55717486493bb622c35ec3796f55
msgid "用户可通过平台 Web 界面与命令行方式使用资源，并结合作业调度系统完成批处理任务。"
msgstr ""
"Users can access resources via the web interface and command line, and run "
"batch jobs through the job scheduler."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:24 105e13d012a141959e6691b12ba3a493
msgid "账号与资源开通"
msgstr "Account and Resource Provisioning"

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:26 7214af7ec37f49c3a8675c4b31c35118
msgid "新用户请先在平台完成注册并提交审批材料。"
msgstr ""
"New users should complete registration and submit approval materials on the "
"platform first."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:28 2a2ce9f85aba4c9899e9d4c081c8cd4a
msgid "账号审批和资源配额由管理员按项目进行分配。"
msgstr ""
"Account approval and resource quotas are assigned by administrators per "
"project."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:30 d691c99b0fca41c3ab826a094ab20140
msgid "外网访问需要提前完成 VPN 或固定 IP 白名单开通。"
msgstr "External access requires VPN or fixed-IP whitelist setup in advance."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:32 f3fa3e73719742f58805b90628615f90
msgid "如需开通或调整资源，请联系管理员邮箱：cnsrc@shao.ac.cn。"
msgstr "To provision or adjust resources, contact cnsrc@shao.ac.cn."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:36 878634cdf1d3455b8af79079447c3593
msgid "使用规范"
msgstr "Usage Policy"

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:40 7cc0893c99344a48843d33d0d8811bd6
msgid "计算资源按平台规则进行计量和扣费，具体配额、计量口径和可用资源类型以平台“用量/限额”页面为准。"
msgstr ""
"Compute resources are metered and billed per platform rules. See the "
"\"Usage/Quota\" page for quotas, metering, and available resource types."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:42 33747a12c41c47b080988a0f03ffae65
msgid "平台默认提供基础软件环境与开源工具支持，不提供商业软件授权及其售后支持。"
msgstr ""
"The platform provides baseline software environments and open-source tools "
"by default, not commercial software licenses or vendor support."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:44 e01c3ba520b3498f9a90df4c8641652d
msgid "用户应对自行安装的软件和数据负责，包含版权、合规与安全风险。"
msgstr ""
"Users are responsible for software and data they install, including "
"copyright, compliance, and security risks."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:46 2ec8e0f7da61414b8398ae80c266915e
msgid "请勿在登录节点直接运行高负载任务，应通过调度系统提交作业。"
msgstr ""
"Do not run heavy workloads on login nodes; submit jobs through the "
"scheduler."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:48 7375241ceae24078b972161e6fa4da8a
msgid "如因不当使用导致平台资源、数据或声誉受损，平台保留追责权利。"
msgstr ""
"The platform may pursue accountability if misuse damages resources, data, or"
" reputation."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:52 4bf4d3f40a9944ab94e3e2af142ecdde
msgid "论文致谢模板"
msgstr "Acknowledgement Template"

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro.rst:56 0b6aedcb740e4a97b0ea64cce9a515cb
msgid "本研究使用了由中华人民共和国科学技术部和中国科学院资助研制的中国 SKA 区域中心（cnSRC）。"
msgstr ""
"This work used the China SKA Regional Centre (cnSRC), funded by the Ministry"
" of Science and Technology of the People's Republic of China and the Chinese"
" Academy of Sciences."
